3 things:

1) i've also accidentally hit a priest/ess.  they are really in the way
    in those small temples.  this is a tricky problem that could use a
    clever solution.  however, the current state of affairs is that you
    pay for your mistakes.

2) i don't think you should simply be able to talk your way out of
    "angry" attacks.  that seems, to me, too easy.  charm monster
    fits the bill and availability is an issue.  it would be funny
    to imagine the effect of a monster casting a charm monster spell
    on you (a possible effect would be that the monster would stop
    to avoid hitting you and that you could only attack the monster
    if you were hungry or confused or stunned.  if the monster tried
    to attack you then possibly you could go wild (i.e. return to
    normal)).

3) you should be able to curry favor with your god and possibly
    priest/esses by going on a quest of some sort.  that seems very
    interesting.

